# The sacrifice is "a Desert": with two Shefet Dunes and a Plains in play, the first Dunes activates and may sacrifice the
# second but not the Plains (refused). Activate only as a sorcery: on Bot2's turn, with {2}{W}{W} available from four
# Mox Pearls, the activation is refused; on Bot1's own turn it is allowed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Shefet Dunes
Shefet Dunes
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Shefet Dunes.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Shefet Dunes.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#3.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#4.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {W}{W}{W}{W}
! Bot1.Battlefield.Shefet Dunes#1.Activate(Ability: Sacrifice a Desert)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#3.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#4.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Shefet Dunes#1.Activate(Ability: Sacrifice a Desert)
! Bot1.Choose(Plains)
Bot1.Choose(Tap Shefet Dunes)
Bot1.Choose(Shefet Dunes#2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Shefet Dunes.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 1
